    <string name="about_who">Who made this</string>
    <string name="about_who_text">BentoBar is a personal hobby project by Alexander Kuscher (github.com/kuscher), proudly developed entirely on a Googlebook.</string>
    <string name="about_employer_text">It isn\'t affiliated with the author\'s employer: that employer didn\'t make, sponsor or endorse it, and BentoBar doesn\'t endorse that employer or its products either. The views and choices in it are the author\'s own.</string>
